{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】醫管局回覆查詢稱，多間公立醫院受到電壓驟降影響，部分機電設備要重置系統，工程人員已檢查有關設備，期間無人受傷，亦無病人的治療受影響，所有設備重置系統後已恢復正常服務。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.701770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:07:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:35.188561+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:35.188561+00:00","content_hash":"f20af246e47d4194aa1d3eb2941f9f53e2280a7daba8496b3f62a51c549e5fd1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}